# Topic authorization. This file is the security boundary of the system.
#
# Read docs/SECURITY.md §2 for what each line prevents. The short version: without
# these rules any client that can connect could publish a retained
# `restaurant/table/1/state` and make every browser display food that was never
# cooked — without the backend being involved at all.
#
# Mosquitto syntax notes:
#   `topic`   — literal filter, applies to the preceding `user` block
#   `pattern` — global, and supports %c (client id) and %u (username) substitution
#   read = subscribe, write = publish

# --- Global patterns ----------------------------------------------------------
# Each client may subscribe to its OWN error inbox and no one else's. %c expands to
# the connecting client's MQTT client id. Granting `restaurant/client/+/err`
# instead would turn a private channel into a broadcast one.
pattern read restaurant/client/%c/err

# --- The kitchen --------------------------------------------------------------
# The only identity allowed to publish state. That exclusivity is what makes the
# retained state topics trustworthy.
user kitchen
topic write restaurant/table/+/state
topic write restaurant/kitchen/status
topic write restaurant/client/+/err
topic read  restaurant/table/+/order
topic read  restaurant/kitchen/reset

# --- The public web client ----------------------------------------------------
# Its credentials ship in the JavaScript bundle and are therefore public, so this
# identity is deliberately near-powerless: it may ask for food and watch the
# result. It CANNOT write state — that is the line that matters.
user web-client
topic write restaurant/table/+/order
topic read  restaurant/table/+/state
topic read  restaurant/kitchen/status

# DEMO ONLY. This lets the "Reset all" button work from the browser, which makes a
# walkthrough far easier. It is a destructive, unauthenticated command available to
# anyone who loads the page — delete this line for any deployment that matters, and
# set RESTAURANT_ENABLE_RESET=false as the second layer.
topic write restaurant/kitchen/reset
